ne-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-05-22/25252_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8357.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>串カツ<rt>くしかつ</rt></ruby>～！<ruby>向かい側<rt>むかいがわ</rt></ruby>がひなです。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ちなみに<ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>は<ruby>初<rt>はつ</rt></ruby><ruby>串カツ<rt>くしかつ</rt></ruby>でした😋</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>自分<rt>じぶん</rt></ruby>で<ruby>揚<rt>あ</rt></ruby>げて、<ruby>揚<rt>あ</rt></ruby>げたてをそのまま<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べれるのが<ruby>最高<rt>さいこう</rt></ruby>でした！そして<ruby>楽<rt>たの</rt></ruby>しい！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-05-22/25252_4.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_8358.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ここで<ruby>彼女<rt>かのじょ</rt></ruby>のエピソード。</span></p><p style=\